{
  "info": {
    "name": "ClinicaDentalWeb - Modulo 3 (Parametros por clinica)",
    "description": "Verificacion del Modulo 3: especialidades, consultorios, metodos de pago, horario de atencion y configuracion.\n\nCOMO USARLA:\n1. Levanta el backend (docker compose up -d, o uvicorn).\n2. Asegurate de que exista un superadmin en la base (ver README).\n3. Ajusta las variables de la coleccion si tu superadmin usa otras credenciales.\n4. Corre la carpeta '0. Setup' primero: encadena los tokens automaticamente.\n5. Despues podes correr toda la coleccion con Run Collection: cada request valida su status y su contenido.\n\nLos tokens, el id_clinica y los ids creados se guardan solos en variables de coleccion.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8000" },
    { "key": "superadminUsername", "value": "superadmin" },
    { "key": "superadminPassword", "value": "Superadmin123" },
    { "key": "tokenSuperadmin", "value": "" },
    { "key": "tokenAdmin", "value": "" },
    { "key": "idClinica", "value": "" },
    { "key": "adminUsername", "value": "" },
    { "key": "adminPassword", "value": "" },
    { "key": "idEspecialidad", "value": "" },
    { "key": "idConsultorio", "value": "" },
    { "key": "idMetodoPago", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Setup",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login superadmin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('devuelve access_token', () => pm.expect(body.access_token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "pm.test('el rol es superadmin', () => pm.expect(body.usuario.rol).to.eql('superadmin'));",
                  "pm.test('el superadmin no tiene clinica', () => pm.expect(body.usuario.id_clinica).to.eql(null));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenSuperadmin', body.access_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{superadminUsername}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{superadminPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Guarda el token del superadmin en la variable tokenSuperadmin."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear clinica de prueba",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// username unico para poder correr la coleccion varias veces sin chocar con el 409",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('adminUsername', 'admin.' + Date.now());"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('devuelve la clinica creada', () => pm.expect(body.clinica.id_clinica).to.be.a('number'));",
                  "pm.test('devuelve una password temporal', () => pm.expect(body.password_temporal).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('idClinica', body.clinica.id_clinica);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('adminPassword', body.password_temporal);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenSuperadmin}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nombre\": \"Dental Smiling QA\",\n  \"direccion\": \"Bexhill-on-Sea\",\n  \"telefono\": \"22334455\",\n  \"correo\": \"qa@dentalsmiling.com\",\n  \"admin_username\": \"{{adminUsername}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/clinicas",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["clinicas"]
            },
            "description": "Modulo 2. Guarda idClinica y la password temporal del admin."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login admin de la clinica",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('el rol es admin', () => pm.expect(body.usuario.rol).to.eql('admin'));",
                  "pm.test('pertenece a la clinica creada', () => pm.expect(String(body.usuario.id_clinica)).to.eql(String(pm.collectionVariables.get('idClinica'))));",
                  "pm.test('debe cambiar la password temporal', () => pm.expect(body.usuario.debe_cambiar_password).to.eql(true));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenAdmin', body.access_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{adminUsername}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Guarda el token del admin en tokenAdmin. Todo el Modulo 3 se prueba con este token."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Especialidades",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear especialidad",
          "event": [
